 "_about": "The token tree build_tokens.py turns into tokens.json. cartesia.ai's marketing site declares a shadcn-style semantic layer (--background/--foreground/--primary/--card/\u2026) over a --cartesia-*/--color-cartesia-* palette plus --control-* sizing, --motion-* ramps and --site-* layout vars in its Astro/Tailwind stylesheets, paints it light and re-binds the same roles under .dark (a declared scope the public pages paint only in .dark islands). Declared variables become var leaves resolved per theme; measured values come from raw/components-computed.json (the sign-in surface on play.cartesia.ai shares the same layer). The docs surface (docs.cartesia.ai) is a Mintlify app in Inter \u2014 a separate system recorded in raw/css-vars-docs.json, not merged here.",
